res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3048/304805/远旅皮肤born.mp4_20260922_180103.554.png\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3048/304805/远旅皮肤skill2.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3048/304805/远旅皮肤born.mp4_20260922_180103.554.png\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3048/304805/new远旅皮肤大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3048/304805/远旅皮肤born.mp4_20260922_180103.554.png\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3048/304805/远旅皮肤born.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3048/304805/远旅皮肤born.mp4_20260922_180103.554.png\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">她以为，宇宙是一片寂静的海洋。<br />最初的恒星呼吸着，如同浮游的透明躯体，用微光分隔出宇宙和自我。它们含混地呢喃，无声的私语在行星飞旋间摩擦、振响，重叠出一片万籁俱寂。<br />直到她在这永恒的夜色间拾获了一曲乐章。<br />那是海浪的声音，让银河成为银河，让星云激起成片的浪花。那是风和雷，是鸟鸣与鲸歌，穿越寰宇的嘈杂和孤独，引领着一组温暖的、环复存续的金色弦音，尽管无人回应，仍竭力呼喊着好奇和渴望。<br />她珍重地将它拾起。以星芒为弓，光谱为弦。多好啊，如今宇宙不再寂静无声，有一颗星星要为她的新朋友们歌唱。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"304805\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-304810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/64/Belonging-304810.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“弦的长流”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"The Flowing Strings\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一把以金唱片为设计灵感的琴，一段在银河里漫游的独奏。<br />我们尝试探寻关于琴的故事，然而受访者仅回应以琴声——也许流淌的乐音，就是这把琴最真挚的自白。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-304811.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/7/7d/Belonging-304811.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">水母纱罩裙<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Jellyfish Organza Overskirt</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />125<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一件以深空为底色、以水母为廓形的罩裙，用真丝欧根纱织就，配搭于受访者的晚礼裙之外。<br />这件罩裙在受访者演出时轻轻飘动，我们不禁去想象——当她穿梭于宇宙的海流中时，它会随她的身形浮游，为她捕捉沿途的微光。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-304812.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/cf/Belonging-304812.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“星际奇旅”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Interstellar Voyage\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>似乎是受她表演的姿态吸引，这些流浪的星尘在她身侧凝聚成环。<br />然而当笔者询问受访者对这条环的看法时，她只是低下头，微笑着演奏了一段布鲁克纳的交响曲。</div></div></div></div></div><div id=\"全新语音\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.85.A8.E6.96.B0.E8.AF.AD.E9.9F.B3_New_Voice\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"全新语音_New_Voice\">全新语音<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">New Voice</span></small></span></h2><div><table class=\"wikitable responsive voice-table zh-only\" style=\"margin:0; --size: 23px; width:100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"hide-m\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\"><td style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"Tupo xindiantu.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Tupo_xindiantu.png/107px-Tupo_xindiantu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"107\" height=\"30\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Tupo_xindiantu.png/161px-Tupo_xindiantu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Tupo_xindiantu.png/214px-Tupo_xindiantu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"740\" data-file-height=\"208\" /></td><th>EN</th><th>中</th><th class=\"not-zh\">日</th><th class=\"not-zh\">한</th><th>文本</th></tr><tr><th>入队</th><td><span class=\"hide-pc\">EN </span><i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"En_play_hero304805_fightingvoc_55.mp3\" title=\"play_hero304805_fightingvoc_55\"></i><i class=\"hide-pc\" style=\"margin:10px;\"><i class=\"verticalline\"></i></i><span class=\"hide-pc\">中 <i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Zh_play_hero304805_fightingvoc_55.mp3\" title=\"play_hero304805_fightingvoc_55\"></i></span><i class=\"hide-pc not-zh\" style=\"margin:10px;\"><i class=\"verticalline\"></i></i><span class=\"hide-pc not-zh\">日 <i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Jp_play_hero304805_fightingvoc_55.mp3\" title=\"play_hero304805_fightingvoc_55\"></i></